  "ProjectGuid": "39c52db1-e306-4f80-9618-a8f8a0c4b06a",
  "ProjectName": "OpenAI PropertyValue Generation",
  "Author": "",
  "ProjectDescription": "In this project, XPath selectors are generated using cloud-based AI (OpenAI) to extract country, address, and company information from XML data. The selectors are stored as memory fields (Tools → Custom Fields → Memory Fields) and validated against the test case. The extracted information is then inserted into an OpenXML/Word document.",
